      "Replication": "Disabled",
      "Description": "Allows for DesignScript code to be authored directly",
      "Code": "// Base block, 60 x 60 x 20\nCuboid.ByLengths(CoordinateSystem.ByOrigin(0, 0, 10), 60, 60, 20);\n// Cylinder standing on the block\nCylinder.ByPointsRadius(Point.ByCoordinates(0, 0, 20), Point.ByCoordinates(0, 0, 75), 15);\n// Sphere beside it\nSphere.ByCenterPointRadius(Point.ByCoordinates(42, -38, 12), 12);\n// Cone behind\nCone.ByPointsRadius(Point.ByCoordinates(-45, 40, 0), Point.ByCoordinates(-45, 40, 50), 16);\n// A free curve: projected and hidden-line tested, but it hides nothing\nLine.ByStartPointEndPoint(Point.ByCoordinates(-80, -80, 5), Point.ByCoordinates(80, 80, 5));"
    },
